age 1-4 roadmap.Also resolves a torch-capable Python interpreter for training tools(tools/v8_python_env.ts) so R8-06/R8-07 run in this environment.Default production AI is still HeuristicAI; no game rule, engine orHeuristicAI behaviour was changed; 30k remains BLOCKED/NOT_RUN.--- .../corrections/CORRECTIONS.md                |   256 + .../closure_02_changes.patch                  |     1 + .../dagger_round2_paired_evaluation.json      |  6206 +++++ .../dagger_round2_summary.json                |   906 + .../runtime_fallback_analysis.json            |   173 + .../search_stage_profile.json                 |   139 + .../stage1_training_design.md                 |   114 + .../task-status.json                          |   397 + .../v8_closure_audit_report.md                |  1035 + .../v8_closure_facts.json                     |   716 + .../v8_runtime_fallback_benchmark.json        | 21292 ++++++++++++++++ tools/v7_counterfactual_dagger.ts             |   197 +- tools/v7_heuristic_bounded_search.ts          |   198 +- tools/v7_training_pipeline.ts                 |     8 +- tools/v7_unified_evaluation.test.ts           |    10 +- tools/v7_unified_evaluation.ts                |    42 +- tools/v8_closure_facts.ts                     |   763 + tools/v8_closure_report.ts                    |  1124 + tools/v8_directory_guard.test.ts              |   163 +- tools/v8_python_env.ts                        |    71 + tools/v8_r8_05_sampling_split_hash.test.ts    |    17 +- .../v8_r8_06_spatial_learning_sanity.test.ts  |    16 +- tools/v8_r8_07_dagger_loop.test.ts            |   313 +- tools/v8_report_consistency.test.ts           |   263 +- tools/v8_run_dagger_round2.ts                 |   220 + tools/v8_runtime_fallback.test.ts             |    80 + tools/v8_runtime_fallback_analysis.test.ts    |   175 + tools/v8_runtime_fallback_benchmark.ts        |   445 + tools/v8_runtime_gate.test.ts                 |    71 +- tools/v8_search_profile.ts                    |   139 + tools/v8_